OL,3,AFuel prices added to Google Maps as
OL,4,Apetrol and diesel costs soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes days after the price of diesel
OL,7,Ftopped #2 per litre for the first time,
OL,8,Fwhich RAC policy head Simon Williams
OL,9,Fdescribed as "a price threshold no one
OL,10,Fwanted to cross".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
