OL,3,ASuffragette role 'a gift' says Beverley
OL,4,AKnight
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger Beverley Knight said she hoped
OL,7,Faudiences watching her latest musical
OL,8,Fwould leave feeling "empowered" and
OL,9,Fwith the belief that their voices can
OL,10,Fmake a difference.
OL,12,FSylvia the Musical tells the story of
OL,13,Fsuffragette Sylvia Pankhurst and the
OL,14,Ffamily rift caused by the fight for
OL,15,Fwomen's voting rights.
OL,17,FThe Wolverhampton artist, who plays
OL,18,FSylvia's mother and suffragette leader
OL,19,FEmmeline Pankhurst at the Birmingham
OL,20,FHippodrome said she was a "history
OL,21,Fnerd" and described the part as a "gift
OL,22,Fof a role".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
